      "$comment": "Shipped next to the binaries to satisfy GPL-3.0. Extracted from the same archive as ffmpeg, so the text always matches the build we actually ship. No macOS entry: the martin-riedl zips carry only the binary, so LICENSE-ffmpeg.txt for macOS comes from resources/ instead.",
